# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# The store Worker's asset server reads these rules too (Workers static assets), so only add a rule the Worker already
# answers itself, before its assets (commerce/worker/redirects.js; a test checks this). Anything else would apply on
# the Worker as well: an /admin rule, for one, sent the back office round in circles there.
#
# Exact /us (and trailing slash) → domain root. Do NOT splat /us/* —
# /us/guides and /us/assets must keep serving at their current paths.
/us https://www.shopapgo.com/ 301
/us/ https://www.shopapgo.com/ 301
